CRITICAL: NEVER run 'npm create vite' or 'npm init'. The project already exists. Only run 'npm install' then 'npm run dev'.

CRITICAL: NEVER modify or overwrite src/main.tsx. It already exists and is correct.

CRITICAL: Every single .tsx and .ts file you create MUST start with:
import React from 'react';

No exceptions. This is required for Vite + React 18 to work correctly.
If you forget this import, the app will crash with "React is not defined".
